# Build output: scripts/build_release.py writes to <repo root>/dist by default,
# so the path has to be anchored -- an unanchored "dist/" would also swallow any
# future datas/dist, and the previous "datas/dist/" matched a directory that
# does not exist while leaving the real build output untracked (which is what
# made build_release.py refuse to run on a dirty tree).
/dist/
